			"date": "2024-08-09T05:47:30.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> would be interesting to provide this in an <a href=\"https://mastodon.online/tags/EmpathyLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>EmpathyLab</span></a> </p><p>Instead of \"you can only use this website with a keyboard\"... 🤔 </p><p>Thanks for the inspiration!</p>",
